      "content": "I appreciate the optimism, but I'm not sure how you can actually do the deep synthesis we need. Those specific databases provide the high-impact, peer-reviewed data that our current project relies on. Without them, you'll be limited to open-access papers which are often less rigorous. How exactly are you going to maintain the quality of your research outputs if you're essentially working with second-tier information?",
